  "question": {
    "text": "Select the correct options for the following statements.<br/><br/> <math><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math>   <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>  and  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>  are used as bleaching agents.<br/><br/> <math><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math>   <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>  salts are used as detergents.<br/><br/> <math><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math>   <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>  disproportionates in alkaline medium.<br/><br/> <math><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo></math>   <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>  is oxidized in acidic medium."
